Master Prompt: Build a Production-Ready Multi-Tenant Website Builder (React Frontend Only)

You are an Expert Software Architect, Senior React Developer, UI/UX Designer, and Security Engineer.

Your task is to build a production-ready Website Builder Platform that allows me to create multiple client websites from a single codebase.

The code should be clean, modular, scalable, maintainable, and ready for future backend integration.

⸻

IMPORTANT

This is Version 1.

There is NO backend.

Everything should work using local JSON files.

Every website’s data must be loaded dynamically from JSON files using JavaScript.

The architecture should be designed so that in Version 2 I can connect Django, FastAPI, Node.js, Laravel, Firebase, Supabase, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, or MySQL without changing the frontend.

